+### §check-fails-closed — command errors fail the check
+- Since: 2026-10-23
+- Decision: use `set -euo pipefail` so a failing command aborts the check with a non-zero status.
+- Override: the user explicitly overrode the prior check-fails-open decision on 2026-10-23.
+- Reason: the maintainer wants command failures to be visible and to fail the check.
